NSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Tento prohlížeč není v současné době podporován. Použijte nejnovější verzi prohlížeče Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari nebo Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Další informace<0> o podpoře prohlížečů</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Již brzy bude k dispozici přihlašování prostřednictvím třetích stran","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Ke službám Autodesk se budete se moct přihlašovat pomocí účtů, které již používáte. Zjistěte, co je nového a co to pro vás znamená.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Další informace","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Nově je k dispozici přihlašování prostřednictvím třetích stran","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Přihlaste se ke službě Autodesk pomocí účtů, které již používáte. Pokud tuto možnost nevidíte, zapněte ji v tomto prohlížeči.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Zjistěte, co se mění","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Povolit"},"da":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Denne browser understøttes ikke i øjeblikket. Brug den nyeste version af Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari eller Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Få flere oplysninger<0> om browsersupport</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Tredjepartslogin kommer snart","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Du vil kunne logge på Autodesk med konti, du allerede bruger. Få mere at vide om, hvad der er nyt, og hvad det betyder for dig.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Få mere at vide","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Tredjepartslogin er nu tilgængeligt","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Log på Autodesk med konti, du allerede bruger. Hvis du ikke kan se indstillingen, skal du slå den til for denne browser.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Få mere at vide om, hvad der ændrer sig","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Aktivér nu"},"de":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Dieser Browser wird derzeit nicht unterstützt. Verwenden Sie die neueste Version von Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari oder Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Weitere Informationen zur <0>Browser-Unterstützung</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Anmeldung mit Drittanbieter-Konten in Kürze verfügbar","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Sie können sich dann mit Konten, die Sie bereits verwenden, bei Autodesk anmelden. Erfahren Sie, was es Neues gibt und was es für Sie bedeutet.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Weitere Informationen","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Anmeldung mit Drittanbieter-Konten jetzt verfügbar","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Melden Sie sich bei Autodesk mit Konten an, die Sie bereits verwenden. Wenn die Option nicht angezeigt wird, aktivieren Sie sie für diesen Browser.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Erfahren Sie, was sich ändert","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Jetzt aktivieren"},"es":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"No se admite actualmente este navegador. Utilice la versión más reciente de Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari u Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Más información<0> sobre la compatibilidad con los navegadores</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"El inicio de sesión de terceros estará disponible próximamente","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Podrá iniciar sesión en Autodesk con las cuentas que ya utiliza. Descubra las novedades y cómo le afecta.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Más información","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"El inicio de sesión de terceros ya está disponible","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Inicie sesión en Autodesk con las cuentas que ya utiliza. Si no ve la opción, actívela para este navegador.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Descubra qué va a cambiar","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Activar ahora"},"fi":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Tätä selainta ei tällä hetkellä tueta. Käytä Chromen, Edgen, Firefoxin, Safarin tai Operan uusinta versiota.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Lue lisätietoja <0>selaintuesta</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"3. osapuolen kirjautuminen on tulossa pian","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Voit kirjautua Autodeskiin jo käyttämilläsi tileillä. Tutustu uusiin ominaisuuksiin ja niiden vaikutuksiin.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Lue lisää","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Kolmannen osapuolen kirjautuminen on nyt käytettävissä","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Kirjaudu sisään Autodeskiin jo käyttämilläsi tileillä. Jos et näe vaihtoehtoa, ota se käyttöön tässä selaimessa.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Tutustu muutoksiin","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Ota käyttöön nyt"},"fr":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Ce navigateur n\'est actuellement pas pris en charge. Veuillez utiliser la dernière version de Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari ou Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"En savoir plus<0> sur la prise en charge des navigateurs</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"La connexion via des comptes tiers sera bientôt disponible","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Vous pourrez vous connecter à Autodesk avec les comptes que vous utilisez déjà. Découvrez les nouveautés et ce que cela signifie pour vous.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"En savoir plus","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"La connexion via des comptes tiers est maintenant disponible","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Connectez-vous à Autodesk avec les comptes que vous utilisez déjà. Si vous ne voyez pas l\'option, activez-la pour ce navigateur.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Découvrez ce qui change","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Activer maintenant"},"fr-CA":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Ce navigateur n’est actuellement pas pris en charge. Veuillez utiliser la dernière version de Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari ou Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"En savoir plus<0> sur la prise en charge des navigateurs</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"La connexion via des comptes tiers sera bientôt disponible","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Vous pourrez vous connecter à Autodesk avec les comptes que vous utilisez déjà. Découvrez les nouveautés et ce que cela signifie pour vous.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"En savoir plus","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"La connexion via des comptes tiers est maintenant disponible","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Connectez-vous à Autodesk avec les comptes que vous utilisez déjà. Si vous ne voyez pas l\'option, activez-la pour ce navigateur.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Découvrez ce qui change","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Activer maintenant"},"hu":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Ez a böngésző jelenleg nem támogatott. Kérjük, használja a Chrome, az Edge, a Firefox, a Safari vagy az Opera legújabb verzióját.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"További információ<0> a böngészők támogatásáról</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"A külső bejelentkezés hamarosan elérhető lesz","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"A már használt fiókokkal jelentkezhet be az Autodeskbe. Ismerje meg az újdonságokat, és azt, hogy ezek mit jelentenek az Ön számára.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"További információ","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"A külső bejelentkezés mostantól elérhető","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Jelentkezzen be az Autodeskbe a már használt fiókjaival. Ha nem látja a lehetőséget, kapcsolja be ehhez a böngészőhöz.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Ismerje meg, hogy mi változik","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Engedélyezés most"},"it":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Questo browser non è attualmente supportato. Utilizzare la versione più recente di Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari o Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Ulteriori informazioni<0> sul supporto dei browser</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"L\'accesso di terze parti sarà disponibile a breve","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Sarà possibile accedere ad Autodesk con gli account già in uso. Scoprire le novità e i relativi vantaggi.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Ulteriori informazioni","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"L\'accesso di terze parti è ora disponibile","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Accedere ad Autodesk con gli account già in uso. Se l\'opzione non è visualizzata, attivarla per questo browser.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Scopri cosa sta cambiando","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Attiva ora"},"ja":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"このブラウザは現在サポートされていません。最新バージョンの Chrome、Edge、Firefox、Safari、Opera のいずれかを使用してください。","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"<0>ブラウザのサポートに関する詳細</0>をご確認ください。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"サードパーティのログインは近日公開予定","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"お使いのアカウントで Autodesk にサインインできるようになります。新機能とその詳細情報を確認してください。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"詳細はこちら","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"サード パーティのログインが利用可能になりました","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"お使いのアカウントで Autodesk にサインインできます。オプションが表示されない場合は、このブラウザでオンにしてください。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"変更点を確認する","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"今すぐ有効にする"},"ko":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"이 브라우저는 현재 지원되지 않습니다. 최신 버전의 Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari 또는 Opera를 사용하십시오.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"<0>브라우저 지원에 대해</0> 자세히 알아보십시오.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"타사 로그인이 곧 제공될 예정입니다.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"이미 사용 중인 계정으로 Autodesk에 로그인할 수 있습니다. 새로운 기능과 이러한 기능이 사용자에게 의미하는 바를 알아보십시오.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"자세히 알아보기","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"이제 타사 로그인을 사용할 수 있습니다.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"이미 사용 중인 계정으로 Autodesk에 로그인합니다. 옵션이 표시되지 않으면 이 브라우저에 대해 옵션을 켭니다.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"변경 사항 알아보기","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"지금 사용"},"nl":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Deze browser wordt momenteel niet ondersteund. Gebruik de nieuwste versie van Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari of Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Meer informatie<0> over browserondersteuning</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Aanmelden voor derden is binnenkort mogelijk","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"U kunt zich bij Autodesk aanmelden met accounts die u al gebruikt. Ontdek wat er nieuw is en wat het voor u betekent.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Meer informatie","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Aanmelden bij derden is nu beschikbaar","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Meld u aan bij Autodesk met accounts die u al gebruikt. Als u de optie niet ziet, schakelt u deze in voor deze browser.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Ontdek wat er verandert","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Nu inschakelen"},"no":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Denne nettleseren støttes ikke for øyeblikket. Bruk den nyeste versjonen av Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari eller Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Finn ut mer<0> om nettleserstøtte</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Innlogging via tredjepart kommer snart","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Du vil kunne logge inn på Autodesk med kontoer du allerede bruker. Lær hva som er nytt, og hva det betyr for deg.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Finn ut mer","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Innlogging via tredjepart er nå tilgjengelig","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Logg inn på Autodesk med kontoer du allerede bruker. Hvis du ikke ser valget, kan du slå det på for denne nettleseren.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Lær hva som endrer seg","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Aktiver nå"},"pl":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Ta przeglądarka nie jest obecnie obsługiwana. Użyj najnowszej wersji przeglądarki Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari lub Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Dowiedz się więcej <0>na temat obsługi przeglądarek</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Już niedługo: logowanie przez systemy zewnętrzne","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Będzie można zalogować się w usługach firmy Autodesk przy użyciu używanych już kont. Poznaj nowości i dowiedz się, to oznacza dla Ciebie.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Dowiedz się więcej","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Już dostępne: logowanie przez systemy zewnętrzne","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Zaloguj się w usłudze firmy Autodesk przy użyciu używanych już kont. Jeśli nie widzisz tej opcji, włącz ją w tej przeglądarce.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Poznaj zmiany","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Włącz tę funkcję"},"pt-BR":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Este navegador não é suportado no momento. Use a versão mais recente do Chrome, do Edge, do Firefox, do Safari ou do Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Saiba mais sobre o <0>suporte ao navegador</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"O login de terceiros estará disponível em breve","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Você poderá entrar na Autodesk com as contas que já usa. Conheça as novidades e o que elas significam para você.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Saiba mais","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"O login de terceiros já está disponível","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Entre na Autodesk com as contas que você já usa. Se você não vir a opção, ative-a para este navegador.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Saiba o que está mudando","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Ativar agora"},"pt-PT":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Este browser não é suportado atualmente. Utilize a versão mais recente do Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari ou Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Saiba mais<0> sobre o suporte ao browser</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"O início de sessão de terceiros será disponibilizado em breve","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Poderá iniciar sessão na Autodesk com contas que já utiliza. Descubra as novidades e o que significam para si.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Saiba mais","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"O início de sessão de terceiros já está disponível","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Inicie sessão na Autodesk com as contas que já utiliza. Se não vir esta opção, ative-a para este browser.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Descubra o que mudou","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Ativar agora"},"en":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"This browser is not currently supported. Please use the latest version of Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari, or Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Learn more<0> about browser support</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"3rd-party login is coming soon","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"You\'ll be able to sign in to Autodesk with accounts you already use. Learn what\'s new and what it means for you.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Learn more","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"3rd-party login is now available","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Sign in to Autodesk with accounts you already use. If you don\'t see the option, turn it on for this browser.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Learn what\'s changing","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Enable now"},"sv":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Den här webbläsaren stöds inte för närvarande. Använd den senaste versionen av Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari eller Opera.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Läs mer<0> om webbläsare som stöds</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"Tredjepartsinloggning kommer snart","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Du kommer att kunna logga in på Autodesk med konton som du redan använder. Läs mer om våra nyheter och vad de innebär för dig.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Läs mer","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"Tredjepartsinloggning är nu tillgänglig","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Logga in på Autodesk med konton som du redan använder. Om du inte ser alternativet kan du aktivera det för den här webbläsaren.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Läs om vad som har förändrats","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Aktivera nu"},"tr":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"Bu tarayıcı şu anda desteklenmiyor. Lütfen Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari veya Opera tarayıcılarının en son sürümünü kullanın.","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"Tarayıcı desteği hakkında daha fazla<0> bilgi edinin</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"3. taraf oturum açma özelliği yakında geliyor","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"Halihazırda kullandığınız hesaplarla Autodesk\'te oturum açabileceksiniz. Yenilikleri ve sizin için ne anlama geldiğini öğrenin.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"Daha fazla bilgi edinin","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"3. taraf oturum açma şimdi kullanılabilir","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"Halihazırda kullandığınız hesaplarla Autodesk\'te oturum açın. Bu seçeneği görmüyorsanız özelliği bu tarayıcı için etkinleştirin.","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"Nelerin değiştiğini öğrenin","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"Şimdi etkinleştir"},"zh-CN":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"当前不支持此浏览器。请使用最新版本的 Chrome、Edge、Firefox、Safari 或 Opera。","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"详细了解<0>浏览器支持</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"即将推出第三方登录","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"您将能够使用已使用的帐户登录 Autodesk。了解新增功能及其对您的意义。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"了解详细信息","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"第三方登录现在可用","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"使用您已使用的帐户登录 Autodesk。如果您看不到该选项，请为此浏览器启用该选项。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"了解正在发生的变化","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"立即启用"},"zh-HK":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"目前不支援此瀏覽器。請使用最新版本的 Chrome、Edge、Firefox、Safari 或 Opera。","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"進一步了解<0>瀏覽器支援</0>","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_TITLE":"第三方登入即將推出","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_DESCRIPTION":"您將能以本來已在使用的帳戶登入 Autodesk。了解有哪些更新及其對您的影響。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_COMING_SOON_CTA":"進一步了解","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_TITLE":"現可以使用第三方登入","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_DESCRIPTION":"以您本來已在使用的帳戶登入 Autodesk。如果您看不到有關選項，請為此瀏覽器開啟有關選項。","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_LEARN_MORE":"了解有什麼變更","THIRD_PARTY_BANNER_ROLLOUT_CTA":"立即啟用"},"zh-TW":{"UNSUPPORTED_BROWSER_DESC":"目前不支援此瀏覽器。請使用最新版本的 Chrome、Edge、Firefox、Safari 或 Opera。","LEARN_MORE_SUPPORT":"進一步瞭解<0>瀏